abstract: "Navigation, route-map, citation, provenance, and current-status index for the Gauged Constant Vacuum-Mode (GCV) framework. References distinguish published Source Assignment, the current Source Law preprint and original provenance, and scoped, conditional, historical, superseded, quarantined or open records; the authoritative scientific objects remain the versioned DOI records and associated Zenodo/OSF archives."
